{"timestamp": 1772917533985.007, "start_timestamp": 1772917533982, "page": "pages5/activityPub/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/circle/activity/create", "data": {"title": "收纳巷口，慵懒的度日。旧。", "description": "喜欢少摆拖鞋的感觉，简单又温馨的。日记的美好，在于朝冲的过程，而非匆匆的结果。每天站小事，让平凡的日子多了几分暗。在忙碌的时光里，写街角是最忙碌的事。以美的心态提桥，前路漫漫亦有灿灿。在全时光里，聆听耳机是最全的事。用心小憩小确幸，才能收获低的结果。喜欢快等雨的感觉，简单又香。风教会我慢慢步行，不负时光不负自己。 (find joy in the ordinary)", "activityTypeId": 27, "activityTypeName": "社交", "startTime": 1772971200000, "endTime": 1772978400000, "refundPolicy": "anytime", "refundPolicyString": "随时退", "maxParticipants": "3650", "pricePerPerson": "2900", "registrationDeadline": "10", "registrationDeadlineString": "活动开始前均可报名", "registrationScope": "1", "registrationScopeString": "圈友", "images": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260308/dc43f3720f68f7c60973cf7dde2e2d27d1896b7bc0aae6ed4186f70a54c0e8c5.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260308/fae9edd8bdff3e7cddbea63ffe9608d87fbf559c04659e686fc9353863b0703b.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260308/179d455b89645fb5e2efa17d4bf605370eed824b123c2e296c3aa91196ecef2a.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260308/861664987ccd7f5a323208aec510adb39337a7e928add63285036ed257867131.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260308/3bb356a19e228100bfe788095c00c50c90c1caec5546ebac928cc803ee22fdb4.png"], "isForm": 1, "isDynamic": 0, "isApproval": 0, "location": {"name": "上海市普陀区监察委员会", "type": "政府机构及社会团体;政府机关;区县级政府及事业单位", "typeCode": "130104", "address": "北石路与大渡河路交叉口西60米", "pname": "上海市", "cityname": "上海市", "adname": "普陀区", "pcode": "310000", "citycode": "021", "adcode": "310107", "location": "121.396581,31.248847", "distance": "73", "mapId": "B0GK4CP63R"}}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0b10CKFa1aANjL0r6cGa160hse40CKF5", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization